  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Reversing the Flow (RtF)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Reversing the Flow (RtF) supports communities in vulnerable situations by strengthening their water security and climate resilience.RtF aims to make communities more resilient with locally-led water, landscape restoration and climate adaptation actions. Local partners, called hubs, support communities to organise and lead these actions themselves.For more information: Reversing the Flow (on english.rvo.nl)Url = https://english.rvo.nl/subsidies-financing/rtf</narrative>
  </description>
